## Best Practices Matrix  

### Command Structure  
1. **Semicolon Chaining**  
   ```powershell  
   Get-Process; Start-Service -Name "MyService"  
   ```  
2. **Explicit Parameters**  
   ```powershell  
   Get-ChildItem -Path $env:USERPROFILE -Filter *.docx  
   ```  

### Error Handling  
```powershell  
try {  
    Remove-Item -Path "NonExistentFile" -ErrorAction Stop  
}  
catch {  
    Write-Warning "Controlled failure: $_"  
}  
```  

### Cross-Platform Formatting  
```powershell  
Write-Output "Line1$([System.Environment]::NewLine)Line2"  
```  
